  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;By virtue of the intensified hours of operation of the enclosed area together with the addition of either live or pre-recorded music within this enclosed area, the proposed variations to conditions 6 and 7 of planning permission 222226 would create an unneighbourly level of noise and disturbance to neighbouring properties. This is harmful to the amenity of existing occupiers of nearby residential properties and contrary to the overall aims and objectives of Policies 44 and 57 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024), which seek to strike a balance of evening/night-time economy uses in appropriate and strategic locations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
